{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-birthday-grading","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:birthday-grading","kind":"definition","title":"Birthday grading on a surreal-coefficient category","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-rigid-monoidal-category"],"cites":["references/conway1976","references/gonshor1986"],"tags":["surreal-numbers","birthday","ordinal","grading","filtration"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.AppendixSurreals.BirthdayGrading","text":"birthday-grading.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:birthday-grading\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">K</code> be a real-closed field extending <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{R}</code> (typically <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">K = \\mathbf{No}</code>, Conway's surreal numbers). The <strong>birthday</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b(x) \\in \\mathrm{Ord}</code> of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">x \\in \\mathbf{No}</code> is the least ordinal stage at which <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">x</code> is constructed in Conway's recursive <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\{L \\mid R\\}</code> presentation.</p>\n<p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}</code> be a <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">K</code>-linear category. The <strong>birthday grading</strong> on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}</code> is the ordinal-indexed filtration of each hom-space</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathbf{C}}(X, Y)_{\\leq \\alpha} = \\bigl\\{ f \\in \\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathbf{C}}(X, Y) : \\text{every coefficient of } f \\text{ has birthday} \\leq \\alpha \\bigr\\}.</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/birthday-grading.md","heading":"Definition","number":"28.2.1","page":"b/def-birthday-grading","qa":{"counts":{"pass":81,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":9,"unknown":0,"stale":63},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Observations.BirthdayGrading","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/BirthdayGrading.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
